一场雨又冲深了，前天还有辆车在那儿翻了。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Mind your purse in the crowd by the gate.","zh":"城门边人多，看好你的钱袋。"}}]}}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk6.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk6"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk6.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk6"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk6.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk6"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk6.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk6"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk7","type":"actor/person/villager","name":{"en":"Ignatius Gracestone","zh":"依纳爵·恩石"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-5","x":6,"y":2},"facing":"down","props":{"age":46,"household":"holy.myrrhwood.h5","purse":3,"favourite":"item/food/fish/pike"},"contents":["holy.myrrhwood.folk7.coin0","holy.myrrhwood.folk7.coin1","holy.myrrhwood.folk7.coin2"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.bun","face":"face.keen","beard":"beard.stubble","outfit":"outfit.workshirt","shoes":"shoes.tall"},"colors":{"skin":"warm","hair":"steelgrey","eyes":"violet","outfit.1":"linen","outfit.2":"moss","shoes.1":"black"}},"npc":{"role":"villager","schedule":[{"from":22,"to":5,"map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-5","x":4,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":5,"to":12,"map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-5","x":6,"y":2,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-5","x":4,"y":4,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-5","x":6,"y":2,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":22,"map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-5","x":4,"y":4,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello. I haven't seen you before. Are you from out of town?","zh":"你好。没见过你，是外地来的吧？"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"You're not from here, are you? There have been more people on the road than usual lately. They say the Church is calling for pilgrims.","zh":"你是外地来的吧？这阵子路上的人比往年多，听说是教会在召朝圣的人。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"It gets dark earlier every day. Our lamp oil used to last till spring; this year I doubt it will see midwinter.","zh":"天黑得一天比一天早了。我家的灯油往年能点到开春，今年怕是撑不到冬至。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Pilgrims come into the city every day now. The inns have been full for weeks, and plenty of them sleep out on the squares.","zh":"这阵子天天有朝圣的人进城，客栈早就住满了，好多人只能在广场上过夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk7.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk7"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk7.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk7"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk7.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk7"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk8","type":"actor/person/farmer","name":{"en":"Eusebius Halowright","zh":"优西比乌·环匠"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"holy.myrrhwood","x":37,"y":15},"facing":"down","props":{"age":55,"household":"holy.myrrhwood.h6","purse":4,"favourite":"item/food/bread"},"contents":["holy.myrrhwood.folk8.coin0","holy.myrrhwood.folk8.coin1","holy.myrrhwood.folk8.coin2","holy.myrrhwood.folk8.coin3"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.thin","face":"face.soft","beard":"beard.stubble","age":"age.lined","mark":"mark.scar","hat":"hat.straw","outfit":"outfit.workshirt","shoes":"shoes.boots"},"colors":{"skin":"light","hair":"silver","eyes":"bark","hat.1":"ochre","outfit.1":"ochre","outfit.2":"moss","shoes.1":"umber"}},"npc":{"role":"farmer","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":5,"map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-6","x":2,"y":1,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":5,"to":12,"map":"holy.myrrhwood","x":37,"y":15,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-6","x":3,"y":2,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"holy.myrrhwood","x":37,"y":15,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":21,"map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-6","x":3,"y":2,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"I've turned the east rows twice this week and the soil is still hard. Other years it would be loose by now.","zh":"东边那几垄我这礼拜翻了两遍，土还是硬邦邦的。往年这时候早就松了。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Pilgrims come into the city every day now. The inns have been full for weeks, and plenty of them sleep out on the squares.","zh":"这阵子天天有朝圣的人进城，客栈早就住满了，好多人只能在广场上过夜。"}}]}}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk8.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk8"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk8.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk8"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk8.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk8"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk8.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk8"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9","type":"actor/person/fisher","name":{"en":"Julian Amberwright","zh":"尤利安·琥珀匠"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-7","x":2,"y":2},"facing":"down","props":{"age":42,"household":"holy.myrrhwood.h7","purse":6,"favourite":"item/material/salt","stock":"item/food/fish/raw*3|item/misc/bait*3"},"tags":["merchant"],"contents":["holy.myrrhwood.folk9.s0.0","holy.myrrhwood.folk9.s0.1","holy.myrrhwood.folk9.s0.2","holy.myrrhwood.folk9.s1.0","holy.myrrhwood.folk9.s1.1","holy.myrrhwood.folk9.s1.2","holy.myrrhwood.folk9.coin0","holy.myrrhwood.folk9.coin1","holy.myrrhwood.folk9.coin2","holy.myrrhwood.folk9.coin3","holy.myrrhwood.folk9.coin4","holy.myrrhwood.folk9.coin5"],"look":{"body":"man","parts":{"hair":"hair.cropped","face":"face.keen","outfit":"outfit.oilcloth","legs":"legs.wraps","shoes":"shoes.tall"},"colors":{"skin":"brown","hair":"black","eyes":"sky","outfit.1":"slate","legs.1":"umber","shoes.1":"leather"}},"npc":{"role":"fisher","schedule":[{"from":21,"to":7,"map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-7","x":2,"y":2,"activity":"sleep"},{"from":7,"to":12,"map":"holy.myrrhwood","x":21,"y":14,"activity":"work"},{"from":12,"to":13,"map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-7","x":7,"y":3,"activity":"eat","tends":["hungry"]},{"from":13,"to":18,"map":"holy.myrrhwood","x":21,"y":14,"activity":"work"},{"from":18,"to":21,"map":"holy.myrrhwood.home-7","x":7,"y":3,"activity":"rest"}],"fidelity":"local","person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"weather:rain","text":{"en":"Fish come up in the rain, so I'll stay out a while longer. If you don't mind getting wet, you can watch.","zh":"下雨天鱼爱往上浮，我得多待一会儿。你不怕淋的话，就在边上看着吧。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The fish have all gone down deep lately. Two all morning, that's all. It wasn't like this in my father's day.","zh":"这阵子鱼都沉到深水里去了，一上午就钓上来两条。我爹那时候可不是这样。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Mind your purse in the crowd by the gate.","zh":"城门边人多，看好你的钱袋。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/food/fish/raw","id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9"}},{"type":"item/food/fish/raw","id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9"}},{"type":"item/food/fish/raw","id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9.s1.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9"}},{"type":"item/misc/bait","id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9.s1.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9"}},{"id":"holy.myrrhwood.folk9.coin1","type":"item/misc/thorn